=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to Luto for a cutscene that begins the quest. She will ask you to retrieve a rare metal that drops from a NM named {m:Metallic Slime} from a certain location. She will ask you to go to one of the following three locations.

|^Zone|Location
|{z:Ordelle's Caves}|(I-5) Second map (Enter from (H-7) {z:La Theine Plateau}
|{z:Korroloka Tunnel}|(F-10) Fifth map
|{z:Ranguemont Pass}|(I-9)

* Touch the **???** spot for a brief cutscene; once it is finished the slime and your Adventuring Fellow will pop. Defeat the slime, then talk to your fellow to trigger a comment about {k:Vitrallum}. Touch the **???** to receive {k:Vitrallum}.
** The slime can be spawned again 3 minutes after it's killed.
* Return to {n:Luto Mewrilah} in {z:Upper Jeuno}.
* You will then need to go to the northern part of the lake in {z:Jugner Forest}. From {z:East Ronfaure}, enter {z:King Ranperre's Tomb}. Exit King Ranperre's Tomb from (K-5), and examine the **???** spot next to the lake around (G-5) for a cutscene that completes the quest.
** The {p:Geomagnetic Fount} to {z:Jugner Forest} is the fastest way there if you have already attuned to it beforehand.
** Using {i:Nexus Cape|Nexus Cape|11538} on someone who has access is another fast method.

